     "text": "Hello everyone. Today, I want to talk about why trees and forests are important for the environment and animals that live there. Trees are like the lungs of our planet. They breathe in a gas called carbon dioxide that is bad for the environment and release oxygen that we need to breathe. Trees help to keep the air clean."
